msgstr ""

#: kplayer.cpp:514
msgid ""
"What's This command changes the mouse pointer to a question mark and lets you "
"click a KPlayer interface element to get a quick description of its purpose and "
"functionality."
msgstr ""

#: kplayer.cpp:519
msgid "Opens the bug report window"
msgstr ""

#: kplayer.cpp:520
msgid ""
"Report Bug command opens a dialog that allows you to send a bug report to the "
"KPlayer developer. However, the recommended way to report a bug is to collect "
"information using this dialog and then submit it following the instructions in "
"the Bug reporting micro-HOWTO."
msgstr ""

