#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:487
msgid "Opens an existing file"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:488
msgid ""
"Open command displays the standard Open File dialog and lets you choose a file "
"or several files to put on the playlist and start playing."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:489
msgid "Open &URL..."
msgstr "URL A&gored ..."

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:490
msgid "Opens a URL"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:491
msgid ""
"Open URL command displays the standard Open URL dialog and lets you type or "
"paste in a URL to put on the playlist and start playing. The URL can be a "
"remote network location, a local file path, a KDE I/O Slave URL or a special "
"URL for playing from various types of devices like DVD, video CD, audio CD, TV "
"or DVB."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:493
msgid "Opens a recently used file"
msgstr "Agor ffeil a ddefnyddiwyd yn ddiweddar"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:494
msgid ""
"Open Recent submenu displays a list of the most recently opened files and URLs "
"and lets you choose one to put on the playlist and start playing."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:497
msgid "Shows playlist items and allows you to select an item to play"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:498
msgid ""
"Playlist combo box in the closed state displays the current playlist item. You "
"can drop down the combo box to see the entire list and select a different item "
"to load and play."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:500
msgid "&Next"
msgstr "&Nesaf"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:501
msgid "Plays the next item on the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:502
msgid "Next command starts playing the next item on the current playlist."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:504
msgid "Plays the previous item on the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:505
msgid ""
"Previous command starts playing the previous item on the current playlist."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:506
msgid "&Loop"
msgstr "&Cylchu"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:507
msgid "Turns the option to loop through the list on/off"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:508
msgid ""
"Loop command toggles the option to start playing items from the beginning of "
"the playlist after playing the last item on the playlist."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:509
msgid "S&huffle"
msgstr "C&ymysgu"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:510
msgid "Turns the option to play items in random order on/off"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:511
msgid ""
"Shuffle command toggles the option to play playlist items in a random order."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:512
msgid "Tempor&ary List For New Entries"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:513
msgid "Turns the option to use temporary list for new entries on/off"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:514
msgid ""
"Temporary List For New Entries command toggles the option to use a temporary "
"playlist when adding new entries. When enabled, this option locks the main "
"playlist, so when you load new items using File Open or File Open URL commands, "
"by dragging and dropping files onto KPlayer window, or by starting KPlayer with "
"file arguments, it creates a temporary playlist, puts the new items on it and "
"starts playing them. To start playing items from the main playlist again, "
"choose Play From Playlist from the Playlist menu."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:515
msgid "Play Selection &Only"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:516
msgid "Toggles the option to play selection only or the entire playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:517
msgid ""
"Play Selection Only command toggles the option to only play items selected in "
"the playlist editor."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:518
msgid "Clear &Before Adding Entries"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:519
msgid "Turns the option to clear list before adding new entries on/off"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:520
msgid ""
"Clear Before Adding Entries command toggles the option to clear the current "
"playlist before adding new items to it. The current playlist can be either the "
"main playlist or the temporary playlist when the Temporary List For New Entries "
"option is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerengine.cpp:424 kplayerplaylist.cpp:521
msgid "&Play"
msgstr "&Chwarae"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:522 kplayerplaylist.cpp:525
msgid "Plays the currently selected playlist item"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:523
msgid ""
"Play command loads and plays the item you right click in the playlist editor."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:524
msgid "Play &From Playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:526
msgid ""
"Play From Playlist command starts playing items from the main playlist. This "
"command is only available when a temporary playlist is being used that has been "
"created because the Temporary List For New Entries option had been enabled."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:527
msgid "&Rename"
msgstr "&Ail-enwi"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:528
msgid "Lets you rename the currently selected playlist item"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:529
msgid ""
"Rename command starts edit mode for the current item in the playlist editor so "
"you can change the item name. This command is available when playlist editor is "
"shown and is not empty."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:530
msgid "Propert&ies..."
msgstr "Priodwedd&au..."

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:531
msgid "Opens Properties dialog for the currently selected playlist item"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:532
msgid ""
"Properties command opens File Properties dialog for the current item in the "
"playlist editor. See the File properties micro-HOWTO for details. This command "
"is available when playlist editor is shown and is not empty."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerengine.cpp:639 kplayerplaylist.cpp:533
msgid "Move &Up"
msgstr "Symud i &Fyny"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:534
msgid "Moves the selected items up in the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:535
msgid ""
"Move Up command moves the currently selected items up in the playlist editor. "
"This command is available when playlist editor is shown and some items are "
"selected. You can also move items around by clicking and dragging them with the "
"left mouse button."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerengine.cpp:636 kplayerplaylist.cpp:536
msgid "Move &Down"
msgstr "Symud i &Lawr"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:537
msgid "Moves the selected items down in the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:538
msgid ""
"Move Down command moves the currently selected items down in the playlist "
"editor. This command is available when playlist editor is shown and some items "
"are selected. You can also move items around by clicking and dragging them with "
"the left mouse button."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:539
msgid "Re&move"
msgstr "G&waredu"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:540
msgid "Removes the currently selected items from the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:541
msgid ""
"Remove command removes from the main playlist items currently selected in the "
"playlist editor. This command is available when playlist editor is shown and "
"some items are selected."
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:542
msgid "&Clear"
msgstr "&Clirio"

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:543
msgid "Removes all items from the playlist"
msgstr ""

#: kplayerplaylist.cpp:544
msgid ""
"Clear command removes all items from the main playlist in the playlist editor. "
"This command is available when playlist editor is shown and is not empty."
msgstr ""

